<LegalLayout
  title="Financial Disclaimer | Hipotecalc"
  description="Hipotecalc financial disclaimer: the calculators are informational tools and their results are estimates, not financial advice."
  heading="Financial disclaimer"
  path="/en/financial-disclaimer"
  lang="en"
  lastUpdated="July 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Informational nature</h2>
  <p>
    Hipotecalc's calculators and content are provided for
    <strong> informational and educational purposes only</strong>. They do not
    constitute financial, tax, legal or investment advice, nor an offer or
    recommendation to contract any financial product. Hipotecalc is not a
    financial institution or a credit intermediary.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Results are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    Calculator results (monthly payments, taxes, interest, returns) are
    <strong> estimates</strong> based on standard formulas and the data you
    enter. The actual terms of a mortgage or property purchase depend on each
    lender, the applicant's profile, the property appraisal and the
    regulations in force at the time, and may differ significantly from the
    estimates shown.
  </p>
  <p>
    In particular, ITP and VAT rates and their regional reductions change
    frequently. Although we strive to keep the data up to date, you should
    verify the applicable rates with your region's tax administration or a tax
    advisor before making any decision.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Official data sources</h2>
  <p>The market data shown on this site comes from official sources:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>12-month Euribor:</strong> the index is administered by the
      <a href="https://www.emmi-benchmarks.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">European Money Markets Institute (EMMI)</a>,
      its original source. The historical series we use comes from the
      <a href="https://data.ecb.europa.eu/data/datasets/FM/FM.M.U2.EUR.RT.MM.EURIBOR1YD_.HSTA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">European Central Bank data portal</a>
      and can also be consulted at the
      <a href="https://www.bde.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bank of Spain</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>ITP and VAT rates:</strong> national and regional legislation
      published by the corresponding tax administrations.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The Euribor values shown are monthly or annual averages for guidance
    purposes; the value applicable to a specific mortgage depends on the
    review date agreed in the deed.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The owner of Hipotecalc accepts no liability for financial, investment or
    purchase decisions made on the basis of the information or results
    obtained on this website, or for any loss or damage arising from them.
    Before taking out a mortgage or making a property investment, consult a
    qualified professional (financial advisor, tax advisor or credit
    intermediary registered with the Bank of Spain).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Recommended official resources</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.bde.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bank of Spain</a>
      — banking supervisor; publishes the official reference indices and
      offers guidance for mortgage holders through its Bank Customer Portal.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.emmi-benchmarks.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EMMI — European Money Markets Institute</a>
      — administrator of the Euribor and the index's original source.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://data.ecb.europa.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">European Central Bank — Data Portal</a>
      — official historical interest rate series.
    </li>
  </ul>
</LegalLayout>
